{"chapters":[{"title":"Middle as root, recurse on index ranges","code":"def sorted_array_to_bst(nums):\n    def make(lo, hi):\n        if lo > hi:\n            return None\n        mid = (lo + hi) // 2\n        return TreeNode(nums[mid], make(lo, mid - 1), make(mid + 1, hi))\n\n    return make(0, len(nums) - 1)","frames":[{"caption":"<strong>Middle as root, recurse on index ranges</strong> &mdash; O(n) time, O(log n) extra space. Input: <code>sorted_array_to_bst(nums=[-10, -3, 0, 5, 9])</code>. Step through to watch the code work on this input.","line":1,"panels":[{"t":"arr","id":"nums","label":"nums","v":["-10","-3","0","5","9"],"cls":["","","","",""]}],"vars":[],"stack":[]},{"caption":"<code>def make(lo, hi):</code>","line":2,"panels":[{"t":"arr","id":"nums","label":"nums","v":["-10","-3","0","5","9"],"cls":["","","","",""]}],"vars":[],"stack":[]},{"caption":"<code>return make(0, len(nums) - 1)</code> &mdash; calls <code>make(lo=0, hi=4)</code>","line":8,"panels":[{"t":"arr","id":"nums","label":"nums","v":["-10","-3","0","5","9"],"cls":["src","","","","src"],"ptr":{"4":["hi"],"0":["lo"]}}],"vars":[["lo","0",1],["hi","4",1]],"stack":["sorted_array_to_bst(nums)","make(lo=0, hi=4)"]},{"caption":"<code>if lo &gt; hi:</code> &rarr; <strong>false</strong> (hi = 4, lo = 0)","line":3,"panels":[{"t":"arr","id":"nums","label":"nums","v":["-10","-3","0","5","9"],"cls":["src","","","","src"],"ptr":{"4":["hi"],"0":["lo"]}}],"vars":[["lo","0",0],["hi","4",0]],"stack":["sorted_array_to_bst(nums)","make(lo=0, hi=4)"]},{"caption":"<code>mid = (lo + hi) // 2</code> &mdash; <code>mid = 2</code>","line":5,"panels":[{"t":"arr","id":"nums","label":"nums","v":["-10","-3","0","5","9"],"cls":["src","","src","","src"],"ptr":{"4":["hi"],"0":["lo"],"2":["mid"]}}],"vars":[["lo","0",0],["hi","4",0],["mid","2",1]],"stack":["sorted_array_to_bst(nums)","make(lo=0, hi=4)"]},{"caption":"<code>return TreeNode(nums[mid], make(lo, mid - 1), make(mid + 1, hi))</code> &mdash; calls <code>make(lo=0, hi=1